{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:04 2026-06-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:04 2026-06-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:04 2026-06-25 HKT</p><p>天后發生墮石屎傷人事件。今日（25日）下午2時17分，電氣道130至140號泰華大廈地下連鎖肉檔「錢大媽」的一名女職員，在店舖後門天井位工作，其間大廈有石屎剝落並由高處墮下。女職員猝不及防，被剝落的石屎擊中腰部受傷，她其後由救護車送往律敦治醫院治理。</p><p>警方在場調查，發現墮下的石屎共有3塊，各長約一呎，正調查石屎剝落的位置，暫未有人被捕。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afecb8803b485fc9623ed5b4b3b0149b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-25_at_15_42_50.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e36b04bd9bfdcc8097233ac1ccf0a17b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-25_at_15_42_49_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93a005abea280c02914215e8d9c683c3/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-25_at_15_42_49.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3268668b1ec09f79c81e81435a65533f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-25_at_15_42_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f182c699004b6e202be7362ef1adfbe/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-25_at_15_42_48.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到店舖後門調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/751a860d95e3f7886d776c430a2aac33/2026-06/2_0_36.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/999f32284c4b8c216f3e8bd41be5fe01/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-25_at_15_42_47_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e183235137748a8bee0664b6fe6ca3ae/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-25_at_15_42_47.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T08:45:49.917075+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}